# Product first · Commercial architecture is reference

## Priority

1. Build a solid, professional ERP.
2. Frontend strategy docs under CLoudAlahiaPos (`Estrategia-Comercial`, `Mapa-Definitivo-Modulos`, investigación) are **reference**, not a reason to reshape APIs for packaging convenience.
3. Pricing / GTM wait until the product is mature.

## When building or improving a module

- Align new module codes and `Empresa_Modulos` gates with the hybrid map when licensing is involved.
- Prefer improving the module (API, data, correctness) over changing commercial packaging.
- Only propose commercial-architecture changes for a **strong business reason**; ask before editing strategy docs.

## What not to do in normal development

- Do not invent SKUs, plan tiers, or price tables while shipping product work.
- Do not block product fixes for commercial-map edge cases—note drift briefly and keep building.
